      "title": "Starbucks reportedly exploring Chipotle takeover",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/08/starbucks-chipotle-merger",
      "description": "<p>Move would reunite chief executive Brian Niccol with chain he led before joining coffee company two years ago</p><p>Starbucks has explored a takeover of Chipotle Mexican Grill, the <a href=\"https://www.ft.com/content/79cef26a-e5e9-41d0-9af2-876dc23a9a7d?syn-25a6b1a6=1\">Financial Times </a>reported on Thursday, in a move that ⁠would reunite chief executive Brian Niccol with the burrito chain he led before joining the coffee giant two years ago.</p><p>The potential deal comes as restaurant chains wrestle with uncertain demand from inflation-weary ⁠consumers and rising operating costs, prompting ⁠companies to look ​for new avenues of growth while facing pressure to improve profitability.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/08/starbucks-chipotle-merger\">Continue reading...</a>",
